{"id": "t166-001", "text": "Afua's mum had a fall on Sunday and broke her wrist. She's having it set at the fracture clinic on Thursday at 10am. Remind me to text Afua that evening to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke her wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having it set at the fracture clinic", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 10am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Afua", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Afua", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t166-008", "text": "Lena told me her dad is in hospital again with his heart. She's driving up to Leeds tonight and will probably stay until Monday. Her brother lives in Spain and can't get a flight until the weekend, so it's mostly on her for now. She said the doctors are talking about a pacemaker but nothing is decided. Don't forget to ring her on Wednesday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Spain", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flight", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t166-010", "text": "Rebecca's partner Mihai sprained his ankle playing five-a-side last night. He's on crutches for at least two weeks, which he is not happy about.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mihai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sprained his ankle", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "at least two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not happy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t166-013", "text": "Aleksander, or Olek as everyone calls him, has been signed off work with a slipped disc. He's bored out of his mind at home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleksander", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olek", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off work", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slipped disc", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored out of his mind", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t166-016", "text": "Anika's sister Meera is expecting her first baby in March 2027. Anika is going to be an auntie and can't stop talking about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "going to be an auntie", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stop talking about it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t166-020", "text": "Ahmed's dog Biscuit had to have a tooth removed at the vet this morning. Ahmed said she's groggy but fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "have a tooth removed", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t166-021", "text": "Jonah is moving to Bristol at the end of November. His girlfriend got a job at the university there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the university", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t166-022", "text": "Keisha mentioned that her son Ethan has his first football match for the under-nines on Saturday morning. He's been practising in the garden every evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first football match", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}]}
{"id": "t166-023", "text": "Bogdan's wife Joanna is having her gallbladder out on 9 December 2026. He'll be taking the week off to look after the kids. I should drop round a lasagne the day after she comes home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bogdan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joanna", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her gallbladder out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round a lasagne", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "comes home", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t166-024", "text": "Kevin has been really struggling since his dad went into the care home. He said visits are hard because his dad doesn't always recognise him. He goes on Sunday afternoons with his sister Angela, and they usually go for a drink afterwards to decompress. He also mentioned the house will have to be sold in the new year, which he's dreading. Must remember to ask him how this Sunday went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went into the care home", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visits", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't always recognise him", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoons", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sold", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how this Sunday went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t166-025", "text": "Sunil is training for the Manchester half marathon in April 2027. He runs before work most mornings.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sunil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Manchester half marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "runs", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before work most mornings"}]}
{"id": "t166-026", "text": "Gym at 7am tomorrow, then dentist at 11. Must remember to cancel the Thursday class.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Gym", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7am tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cancel the Thursday class", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday"}]}
{"id": "t166-027", "text": "Bruno's mum is coming over from Italy for three weeks in November. He's a bit anxious because she's recently had a hip replacement and the stairs in his flat are steep. He's thinking of giving her his bedroom and sleeping on the sofa. She lands at Gatwick on the 6th at about 4pm and his car is still in the garage, so I said I'd drive him there to pick her up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Italy", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks in November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "recently", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stairs in his flat are steep", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lands at Gatwick", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th at about 4pm", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t166-029", "text": "Hugo's partner Valentina just got the all clear after her biopsy. Huge relief for both of them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "all clear", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t166-030", "text": "Andre says his little brother has his driving test on Wednesday at 8:40am. He's failed twice already and is a nervous wreck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 8:40am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "failed twice", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous wreck", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t166-033", "text": "Jada's dad had a mild stroke last weekend. He's home now and doing physio three times a week. Jada sounded tired but okay. Don't forget to ask how his speech is coming along when I see her on Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mild stroke", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing physio", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how his speech is coming along", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see her on Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t166-035", "text": "Angela's son got the job at the bank! He starts on the 4th of January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the bank", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th of January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t166-036", "text": "Remind me to text Kwame the morning of his interview. It's Tuesday at 10:15, and he's really nervous.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Kwame", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday at 10:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t166-037", "text": "Valentina said her mother-in-law is staying with them for a month while she recovers from a knee replacement. Valentina is being very polite about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mother-in-law", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee replacement", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t166-042", "text": "Aisha's parents celebrate their 40th wedding anniversary on 3 April 2027. She and her sisters are planning a surprise meal and I said I'd help with the invitations.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th wedding anniversary", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3 April 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sisters", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise meal", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t166-047", "text": "Kevin collects vinyl, mostly old soul and jazz. Said he's been hunting for a first pressing of a Nina Simone album for years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old soul", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "jazz", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hunting for a first pressing of a Nina Simone album", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}]}
{"id": "t166-048", "text": "Called Anika to see how her dad's operation went last Thursday. It went well and he's already walking with a frame. She's going up to see him again this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "walking with a frame", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up to see him", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t166-049", "text": "Meera's daughter had a nasty bout of chickenpox, so they cancelled her sixth birthday party. They're hoping to rearrange it for some time in December.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chickenpox", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sixth birthday party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "some time in December", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t166-050", "text": "Bruno and his wife are expecting their second baby. Due date is late May 2027.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "late May 2027", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t166-055", "text": "Spoke to Yetunde this morning. Her grandad's hip operation, which was meant to be on 5 November 2026, has been called off because of a bed shortage. No new date yet, and the whole family is frustrated. Her mum has been driving over every day to help him with shopping and his medication. Remind me to ring Yetunde next week to see if they've heard anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "5 November 2026"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "frustrated", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring Yetunde", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yetunde", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t166-060", "text": "Valentina's brother Santi had his first chemo session yesterday. She said he handled it better than expected but is completely wiped out today. Their parents are flying in from Madrid on the 3rd and staying until Christmas. I should send her something on Friday, maybe a food delivery, and remember to ask how the second session goes the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Valentina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first chemo session", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wiped out", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Madrid", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the second session goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second session", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
